       215 |       1 |     214 |   1 |    1 |   1 |      1 |       1 |        1 |           1 |         1 |        1 |   2 |    3 | BAAAAA   | GIAAAA   | OOOOxx
       307 |      20 |     306 |   0 |    0 |   0 |      0 |       0 |       20 |          20 |        20 |       20 |   0 |    1 | UAAAAA   | ULAAAA   | OOOOxx
       102 |      99 |     101 |   1 |    3 |   9 |     19 |       9 |       99 |          99 |        99 |       99 |  18 |   19 | VDAAAA   | XDAAAA   | HHHHxx
